---
// src/components/home/Hero.astro
---
<header class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="hero-txt">
    <div class="eyebrow">遺產稅・贈與稅・財產傳承規劃</div>
    <h1>
      <span class="line l1"><span class="line-inner">財產怎麼傳，</span></span>
      <span class="line l2"><span class="line-inner"><mark>稅差很大</mark>。</span></span>
    </h1>
    <p class="sub">遺產稅、贈與稅、房地合一稅——傳給下一代的每個決定都牽動稅金。台中中友地政士事務所，三位地政士的代書世家：先幫你把稅算清楚，再決定怎麼傳。</p>
    <div class="names"><span>蔡峻豪</span><span>蔡崇欽</span><span>丁玉梅</span></div>
    <div class="btns">
      <a class="btn dark" href="https://line.me/R/ti/p/%400955377283" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LINE 諮詢</a>
      <a class="btn ghost" href="tel:+886955377283">電話 0955-377-283</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="family portrait" id="pt">
    <img class="p-side left" src="/portrait-tsai-chongqin.svg" alt="蔡崇欽地政士" width="210" height="260" />
    <img class="p-main" src="/portrait-placeholder.svg" alt="蔡峻豪地政士" width="300" height="380" />
    <img class="p-side" src="/portrait-ding-yumei.svg" alt="丁玉梅地政士" width="210" height="260" />
  </div>
  <div class="watermark" id="wm">中友代書</div>
</header>

<style>
.hero{min-height:100svh; position:relative; display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;
  align-items:center; padding:0 5vw; overflow:hidden}
.hero-txt{position:relative; z-index:2; padding-top:60px}
.eyebrow{font-size:12.5px; letter-spacing:.32em; color:var(--seal); font-weight:700; margin-bottom:22px;
  opacity:0}
h1{font-size:clamp(36px,5.8vw,72px); line-height:1.26; font-weight:900; letter-spacing:.01em; text-wrap:balance}
.line{overflow:hidden}
.line-inner{display:block; transform:translateY(112%)}
.l2 mark{background:none; color:inherit; box-shadow:inset 0 -0.22em var(--gold-tint)}
.hero .sub{color:var(--sub); font-size:16px; max-width:30em; margin:26px 0 12px; opacity:0}
.names{display:flex; gap:18px; font-size:14px; color:#3A3D45; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:30px;
  opacity:0; flex-wrap:wrap}
.names span::before{content:"印"; font-size:10px; color:var(--paper); background:var(--seal); border-radius:3px;
  padding:1px 4px; margin-right:7px; vertical-align:2px}
.btns{display:flex; gap:14px; opacity:0; flex-wrap:wrap}
.btn{display:inline-block; padding:15px 34px; font-size:14.5px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:.1em;
  text-decoration:none; transition:transform .25s cubic-bezier(.2,1.4,.4,1), box-shadow .25s}
.btn:hover{transform:translateY(-3px)}
.btn.dark{background:var(--ink); color:var(--paper)}
.btn.dark:hover{box-shadow:0 14px 30px rgba(21,23,28,.25)}
.btn.ghost{border:1.5px solid #C9C6BD; color:var(--ink)}
.btn.ghost:hover{border-color:var(--gold); color:var(--gold-dark)}
.family{position:relative; z-index:2; align-self:end; display:flex; align-items:flex-end;
  justify-content:center; opacity:0; transform:translateY(50px); will-change:transform}
.family img{display:block; height:auto}
.family .p-main{width:min(300px,26vw)}
.family .p-side{width:min(210px,18vw); margin:0 -30px}
.family .p-side.left{order:-1}
.watermark{position:absolute; left:0; right:0; bottom:-4vw; z-index:1; font-weight:900;
  font-size:clamp(100px,19vw,260px); letter-spacing:.04em; color:#F2F0EB; white-space:nowrap;
  line-height:1; pointer-events:none; will-change:transform; text-align:center}

@media (max-width:780px){
  .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr; align-items:start; padding-top:90px}
  .family{max-width:92%; margin:0 auto}
  .family .p-main{width:44vw}
  .family .p-side{width:30vw; margin:0 -18px}
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
  /* 勿刪：motion.ts 的降級分支不含 .eyebrow/.hero .sub/.names/.btns/.portrait，這裡是 reduced-motion 下唯一可見性來源 */
  .eyebrow,.line-inner,.hero .sub,.names,.btns,.portrait{animation:none; opacity:1; transform:none}
}
</style>
